@startuml
title T12-WF10 — AI Next Best Action Agent (Sequence)
autonumber
actor "CRM User/UI" as UI
participant "NestJS Recommendation API" as API
participant "n8n WF10\nNext Best Action" as N8N
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Gemini API" as AI
participant "NestJS Review Module" as REVIEW

UI -> API: POST recommendation request (target route)
API -> API: Authenticate requester and authorize Lead/Customer access
API -> DB: Create WorkflowRun/request record
DB --> API: workflowRunId
API --> UI: 202 Accepted + workflowRunId
API -> N8N: POST protected internal webhook with scoped entity/run reference
activate N8N
N8N -> N8N: Validate entity type, ID and correlation
N8N -> API: GET profile and latest qualification/score
API -> DB: Read profile and intelligence history
DB --> API: Entity context and latest signals
API --> N8N: Profile/intelligence
N8N -> API: GET interactions, follow-up and segment context
API -> DB: Read engagement and membership records
DB --> API: Context or explicit empty state
API --> N8N: Interaction/follow-up context
N8N -> N8N: Generate bounded candidate actions from allowed set
N8N -> AI: Rank/explain only candidate actions using supplied evidence
AI --> N8N: Ranked suggestions and rationale
N8N -> N8N: Validate allowlist, evidence references and confidence
N8N -> API: Save recommendation snapshot
API -> DB: Persist recommendation in approved business record/WorkflowRun
DB --> API: Recommendation ID
API --> N8N: Saved recommendation
alt High-risk action or low confidence requires approval
  N8N -> REVIEW: Request backend creation/ensure of ReviewTask
  REVIEW -> DB: Persist approval task idempotently
  DB --> REVIEW: Task ID
  REVIEW --> N8N: Pending approval
else Recommendation only
  N8N -> N8N: Return suggestion; do not execute action
end
N8N -> API: Record workflow result/output
API -> DB: Update WorkflowRun
DB --> API: Run result
API --> N8N: Status recorded
deactivate N8N
UI -> API: GET recommendation result by workflowRunId
API -> DB: Read recommendation/run result
DB --> API: Recommendation and status
API --> UI: Recommendation, rationale, evidence refs and status
note over API,N8N
Production UI requests must go through NestJS authz; n8n's webhook is protected and
invoked service-to-service. The backend Review Module alone creates/ensures ReviewTask.
end note

note over REVIEW,DB
ReviewTask supports Lead and non-Lead review targets. For a Customer-only action, set
target_entity_type=Customer and target_entity_id to the Customer UUID; NestJS validates the
allowlisted target type, record existence, authorization, policy, idempotency and audit.
end note
@enduml
